241
00:17:35.345 --> 00:17:37.306
Pabayaan mo na lang sila. Malalaman nila ito.

242
00:17:38.640 --> 00:17:40.392
Ano ang ibig mong sabihin?

243
00:17:40.476 --> 00:17:41.685
Paano nila ito gagawin?

244
00:17:55.240 --> 00:17:56.200
